      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW GERTRUDE (6) boasts a strong record this course with seven wins and two minors from 14 tries. Recorded a 1.5 lengths win (30.28) in a Grade 5 last time at The Meadows. Rates a leading player. PAW HAZELTON (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (25.84) at this track behind Upended in a Grade 4/5. Has the pace to be prominent. The form out of his last race has been franked. Will give a great sight again. DEEP THINKER (3) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at Horsham over 485m behind Mister Manfredi (28.33) in a Grade 4/5. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Expected to run well. PAW TORONTO (8) profiles nicely over this trip.",
